  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 2.0,
    "cls_id": "CB08121",
    "sub_id": "38581",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>隨堂測驗（小考）-&nbsp; 預計進行兩次，同學需注意小考時間，若請假需補考要提供正當理由與證明文件。</div>\n\n<div>作業 &nbsp;- &nbsp;不接受遲交或補交，請同學務必留意繳交期限。</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "1. Students are expected to attend classes on time. If you are unable to attend, please follow the school's designated leave procedures.\n2. During class, avoid unrelated conversations or activities. To maintain a respectful atmosphere, mobile devices must be silenced. Also, wearing headphones is not permitted during lectures. \n3. Note-taking with devices is allowed.\n4. Regularly check your school email and log in to iLearn for updates and messages related to this course.",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>學習必須以誠信為基礎，在作業、小考測驗或考試中作弊或抄襲的學生或協助他人的行為，該次成績以零分計。</div>\n\n<div>若是累犯，將依逢甲大學學生獎懲辦法提送。</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>評分方式的各項規則如下：</div>\n\n<div>1. 期中考與期末考時如有抄襲他人的答案、或有自帶小抄嫌疑，則被視為作弊。</div>\n\n<div>2. 出席狀況(如點名或課堂練習)如非本人代為點名或簽名，則被視為作弊。</div>\n\n<div>3. 作業可以小組(1至4人)討論，允許以小組方式繳交一份即可。</div>\n\n<div>4. 小考測驗視同考試方式，如有抄襲他人的答案、或有自帶小抄嫌疑，則被視為作弊。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": null,
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
